source> <volume>93</volume>:<fpage>14922</fpage>&#x02013;14927.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8962157</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib42"><citation citation-type="journal">Yarov-Yarovoy, V., D. Baker, and W.A. Catterall. <year>2006</year>. Voltage sensor conformations in the open and closed states in ROSETTA structural models of K<sup>&#x0002b;</sup> channels. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>103</volume>:<fpage>7292</fpage>&#x02013;7297.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16648251</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib43"><citation citation-type="journal">Zagotta, W.N., T. Hoshi, and R.W. Aldrich. <year>1994</year>. Shaker potassium channel gating. III: Evaluation of kinetics models for activation. <source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source> <volume>103</volume>:<fpage>321</fpage>&#x02013;362.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8189208</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>